{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2023-06-27 16:30:00', 'title': 'HII DELIVERS FIRST FLIGHT III DESTROYER JACK H. LUCAS (DDG 125) TO US NAVY', 'text': "PASCAGOULA, MISS., JUNE 27, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII'S (NYSE: HII) INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION DELIVERED THE\xa0FIRST FLIGHT III ARLEIGH BURKE-CLASS GUIDED MISSILE DESTROYER,\xa0JACK H. LUCAS (DDG 125), TO THE U.S. NAVY TODAY. DELIVERY OF DDG 125 REPRESENTS THE OFFICIAL TRANSFER OF THE SHIP FROM THE SHIPBUILDER TO THE NAVY."}